==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmʏːna/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ʏːna|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|muna|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|-}} {{m|gem-pro|*munaną}}. Cognate with {{etyl|fo|-}} {{term|muna|lang=fo}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-preterite|man|mundi|munað}}

# {{context|with accusative|lang=is}} to [[remember]]
#*: ''Ég '''man''' ekki hvað hann heitir.''
#*:: I can't '''remember''' what his name is.
#*: ''Ég '''man''' ekki.''
#*:: I can't '''remember'''.

===Etymology 2===
Related to {{term|munur||difference|lang=is}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-weak|munaði|munað}}

# {{context|impersonal|with dative|lang=is}} to [[differ]] (by a certain margin)
# {{context|impersonal|lang=is}} to [[make a difference]] (used with the preposition {{term|um|lang=is}} + the thing that makes a difference)

